# Documentation

- [Release](reference/release.md): release facts and mechanics; version rules are in VERSIONING.

This directory is the repository documentation index.

- `architecture/` contains current architecture truth.
- `reference/` contains durable reference material.
- `proposals/` contains design-in-progress when present.
- `decisions/` contains accepted decision records when present.
- `migrations/` contains durable transition records when present.
- `archive/` contains obsolete documents kept for history when present.
- `api/` contains generated or authored Python API reference when present.
